      "writtenOn": "2025-10-02T14:35:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need to expose these functions to clients? Could we just have the behavior of storePipelineCacheData() be that it only sends to the persistent cache *if* there\u0027s new data?\n\nWhat type of behavior change is expected for clients if `canDetectNewPipelineCacheData` returns false? Would they be calling store less often?",
