      "lineNbr": 926,
      "author": {
        "id": 5230
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-02T15:31:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think, practically, if \u0027canDetectNewPipelineCacheData\u0027 returned false then a client should not use \u0027hasNewPipelineCacheDAta\u0027 at all and find other criteria to call \u0027storePipelineCacheData\u0027. Probably either a timer or some internal boundary (e.g., on app exit).",
      "parentUuid": "e90347cc_8accf762",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 920,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 926,
        "endChar": 1
      },
